      "title": "Version 11.2022.3 update",
      "date": "2022-03-29 03:27:56",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4258723269525408514",
      "content": "1. Add civilization log query in Game 1 to query the current civilization development record. The query button is above the planet name, and the button is called \"LOG\".\n2. Add the close-up setting function of civilization extinction in Game 1. Players can set whether to close-up and close-up civilizations that have survived for more than how many years.\n3. In the manual camera mode of Game 1, the function of automatically returning to the original position after close-up is added.",
