      "date": "2022-02-26 21:37:45",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4246335832517445002",
      "content": "[b]1. Add game help function[/b]\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41718830/0f3be30ad6bcb379b34b4f52fcb9cbef060ac50d.png[/img] -> [img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41718830/bdc05a98f283029dfaacfe46cb4ca90fa62b0ed3.png[/img]\n\n[b]2. New civilization research routes and spectacle construction. At present, the research route has only developed agriculture and war, and will continue to be added in the future.[/b]\n\nSelect the research:\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41718830/f7ca14b05e43a5b3dc2b32afd2161a5f543f7327.png[/img]\n->\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41718830/f4829e19001f593b47cefca66c8eb1cc048195cd.png[/img]\n\nEnter wonder construction:\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41718830/22adf86c6fdd561a70dd8113ea0039e19e574b1d.png[/img]\n->\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41718830/623deecd76b290e7c7add04826fa571d080a9212.png[/img]\n\n[b]3. Add the resolution setting and game windowing setting in the settings.[/b]\n\n[b]4. Fix several known bugs.[/b]",
      "key": "1725860::f851fd415568e9c89356e8f279a9439e2163f16a",
      "tags": null
    },
