      "content": "1. Game I: Fix the bug of hidding UI.\n2. The button cannot be muted. The game sound effect in the settings can control the button volume.\n3. Game 2: Fixed the bug of unlimited skill points at the beginning.\n4. Game 2: Fixed the bug that civilizations do not attack each other after level 100.\n\nps: Happy birthday to \u5751\u5c0f\u7403\u306e\u5de8\u7c89.",
